}

/* task-32142 fix round 1 escalated minor: #library-note-preview-body-title
   (the Preview title) carries `.destination-section` like Info's
   Properties/Reuse & Export/Danger headers, but no selector reached it --
   the class was inert there in both sizes. Grouped into the SAME rule its
   Info siblings already use, rather than inventing a new style nothing
   else in this canvas has. */
#library-shell-grid.library-notes-compact #library-note-context-region .destination-section,
#library-shell-grid.library-notes-compact #library-note-preview-region .destination-section,
